---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import PolicyNav from '../components/PolicyNav.astro';
import { getSiteSettings } from '../core/content/service';

const settings = await getSiteSettings();
const brandName = settings.name || 'Event Point Ranchi';
const legalName = settings.legalName || 'Event Point Ranchi';
const address = settings.address || 'Event Point, Main Road, Ranchi, Jharkhand 834001, India';
const phone = settings.phone || '+91 98765 43210';
const email = settings.email || 'info@eventpointranchi.com';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Payment & Booking Policy | ${brandName}`}
  description={`Official payment lifecycle, booking advance rules, partial payments, and server verification standards for ${brandName}.`}
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal & Compliance</span>
      <h1>Payment & Booking Policy</h1>
      <p>
        How booking advances, partial payments, server-side verification, and receipts work at {brandName}.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-narrow policy-content">
      <PolicyNav current="payment-policy" />

      <div class="panel mb-8" style="padding:20px;background:var(--canvas-warm);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-md);">
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);">
          <strong>Entity details:</strong> {legalName} · Accounts Desk: <a href={`mailto:${email}`} class="text-link">{email}</a> · Helpline: <a href={`tel:${phone.replace(/\s/g, '')}`} class="text-link">{phone}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <article id="booking-lifecycle">
        <h2>1. The Complete Booking & Payment Lifecycle</h2>
        <p>
          We follow a structured 4-step payment and confirmation lifecycle to guarantee full transparency and eliminate double-booking:
        </p>
        <ol style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.8;font-size:14px;color:var(--body);">
          <li>
            <strong>Event Quotation & Cart Review:</strong> You select your banquet hall, custom wedding mandap, stage decoration, furniture items, and catering package. An itemized quotation is generated.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Booking Advance (25%):</strong> To lock your event date on our calendar and reserve equipment inventory, an initial advance deposit of 25% of the quotation amount is required.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Server-Side Verification & Status Lock:</strong> Once you complete payment through PhonePe's hosted checkout, our server independently verifies the gateway cryptographic signature and confirms capture with the payment processor. Only upon verified capture does the booking status transition to <em>Confirmed</em>.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Partial Payments & Balance Settlement:</strong> You may make flexible partial payments at any time before the celebration. The final outstanding balance must be settled prior to service delivery or on-site handover.
          </li>
        </ol>
      </article>

      <article id="supported-payment-methods">
        <h2>2. Supported Payment Gateways & Instruments</h2>
        <p>
          We accept payments via India's trusted RBI-licensed Payment Aggregator <strong>PhonePe</strong>:
        </p>
        <ul class="spec-list">
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> <strong>UPI (Unified Payments Interface):</strong> Instant, zero-surcharge payments via Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm, BHIM, Cred, and all BHIM-UPI applications.</li>
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> <strong>Debit & Credit Cards:</strong> All domestic Visa, MasterCard, RuPay, and American Express cards with mandatory Two-Factor Authentication (OTP / 3D Secure).</li>
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> <strong>Net Banking:</strong> Secure direct internet banking across 50+ scheduled Indian commercial banks (SBI, HDFC, ICICI, Axis, PNB, etc.).</li>
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> <strong>Direct Gateway Checkout:</strong> Payments are securely routed via PhonePe's certified payment gateway with 256-bit encryption.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article id="server-verification-security">
        <h2>3. Server-Side Security & Integrity Controls</h2>
        <p>
          To safeguard against fraudulent manipulation and payment tampering:
        </p>
        <ul class="spec-list">
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> <strong>Zero Trust for Client-Submitted Amounts:</strong> Payment amounts and booking IDs are never accepted from browser requests. All payable figures are computed server-side directly from authoritative Neon PostgreSQL records.</li>
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> <strong>Overpayment Prevention:</strong> The payment engine strictly prevents payment attempts that exceed the outstanding booking balance.</li>
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> <strong>Cryptographic Webhook Signature Check:</strong> Asynchronous status webhooks are verified using HMAC-SHA256 signatures with provider webhook secrets before database updates occur.</li>
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> <strong>Idempotency Protection:</strong> Webhook events are hashed and deduplicated. Replayed or duplicate gateway payloads are safely recognized and processed without double-crediting.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article id="failed-pending-payments">
        <h2>4. Handling Failed, Pending, and Abandoned Transactions</h2>
        <ul class="spec-list">
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> <strong>Failed Payments:</strong> If a payment fails due to insufficient funds, bank timeout, or OTP error, your booking remains in <em>Pending</em> status. You can safely retry checkout immediately.</li>
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> <strong>Pending / Processing State:</strong> If your bank account is debited but the gateway reports a pending status, our server reconciles the status via background polling and automated webhooks. If the transaction eventually succeeds, your booking is confirmed automatically without double payment.</li>
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> <strong>Never Mark as Paid on Return URL:</strong> Our application never marks a booking as paid merely because a user's browser returns to the success page; explicit server-to-server gateway verification is mandatory.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article id="receipts-invoicing">
        <h2>5. Digital Payment Receipts and Tax Invoices</h2>
        <p>
          Following every verified transaction, a timestamped digital payment receipt is generated with a unique reference number. You can download and print receipts from your quotation overview page. GST invoices detailing taxable components (CGST/SGST/IGST) are issued upon completion of service fulfillment.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article id="support">
        <h2>6. Billing Inquiries & Payment Support</h2>
        <p>
          For payment verification queries, bank transaction matching, or receipt copies, reach our billing team at <a href={`mailto:${email}`} class="text-link">{email}</a>, call <a href={`tel:${phone.replace(/\s/g, '')}`} class="text-link">{phone}</a>, or visit our office at {address} with your booking reference.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
